# Mirrorweave targets Bot1's Phyrexian Metamorph, which entered as a copy of Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla "except it's an artifact".
# The Metamorph's copiable values are the Gorilla's with that exception (CR 707.9b; the ruling: "If the targeted creature is
# itself copying a creature, each other creature will become whatever it's copying, as modified by that copy effect"), so
# Bot1's Llanowar Elves and Bot2's own Guerrilla Gorilla each become an artifact Guerrilla Gorilla until end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Phyrexian Metamorph
Black Lotus
Mirrorweave
Plains x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x12

